# VenTu Design System

## Principles
- Clarity over effects; animation/gradient only when it aids reading or feedback
- Use base components (`Button`, `Card`, `FilterPill`, `ScoreBadge`, `StatChip`, `EmptyState`); no ad-hoc page CSS
- Performance: prefer opacity/transform; avoid heavy blur on mobile
- A11y: visible focus (globals.css), AA contrast, 44px touch targets on mobile
- Score is product language: always use `getScoreTokens(score)` / `--score-*` tokens

## Tokens (globals.css)
- Surfaces: `bg-base`, `bg-elevated`, `surface-1/2/3`, `divider`, `divider-strong`
- Text: `fg`, `fg-muted` (meta/legends), `fg-subtle` (secondary)
- Sport accents: `--sport-*` / `text-sport-*`
- Spacing scale only: 4, 8, 12, 16, 24, 32, 48 px

## Components
- **Button**: `primary` | `secondary` | `ghost`; sizes `sm`(36) `md`(44) `lg`(48+); `leftIcon`/`rightIcon`; loading shows spinner + label
- **Card**: `card-1` | `card-2` | `card-hero`; clickable → `hover:-translate-y-px`, `hover:border-divider-strong`, light shadow
- **Pill**: `pill-ghost` (inactive) / `pill-active` (active) via `FilterPill`
- **ScoreBadge**: `getScoreTokens`; glow only for epic/good tiers
- **StatChip**: icon + mono value + short label (spot hero metrics)
- **FreshnessIndicator**: pill + coloured dot + “há Nh” + source label (`sm` | `md`)
- **AggregateScoreGauge**: homepage hero — `ScoreGauge` lg for top-10 average by sport
- **TrustStrip** (`homepage/`): horizontal trust row (spot count, sports, Open-Meteo, refresh cadence)
- **HomepageSecondaryCta** (`homepage/`): 3 `Card` links (sazonalidade, compare, spots/alertas)
- **HeaderFreshness** (`layout/`): client fetch of `conditions.json` → `FreshnessIndicator` in header

## Motion
- 150ms hover/focus; 200ms filter/list; 300ms map fullscreen/drawers
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`

## Do not
- Invent colors outside tokens
- Multiple button styles per page
- Continuous animations on home (no marquee loops)
- Heavy backdrop-blur on long mobile sections

## Page patterns
- **Home (5 zones)**: Pulse (sr-only h1, `AggregateScoreGauge`, `FreshnessIndicator`, search) → `TrustStrip` → Top agora (**4** sports: surf, kitesurf, windsurf, bodyboard — `TOP_NOW_SPORTS`) → Explore (filters + map) → More spots (`SpotListCard`, excludes Top agora slugs) → `HomepageSecondaryCta` (3 cards) → Dawn Patrol (5–12h)
- **Spot**: `ScoreGauge` lg + rating label + 4 `StatChip` + “Agora” (radar; wind kt only in chips) + feedback in `card-1` + sticky sport tabs + forecast
- **Map fullscreen**: single bottom HUD (`MapControlButton` 44px), `MapSpotSheet` on mobile
- **Drawer**: real metrics only — no placeholder tabs; sync `gridSport` + `?sport=` on CTA

## Shared list UI
- **`SpotListCard`**: `Card` + `ScoreBadge` + metrics — Top agora + “Mais spots” (never duplicate same slug)
- **Scores**: `getScoreTokens` / `scoreThresholds.ts` — map markers must match badges (80/60/40/20)
